@startuml sequence_mode_or_date_change
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Mode or Selected Date Change

participant TileContext as Ctx
participant ConsistencyTrendController as Ctrl
participant GoalTrendService as Svc
participant ChartJsLineAdapter as Adp
participant "chart.js Chart" as Chart

Ctx -> Ctrl: mode and/or selectedReviewDate change
Ctrl -> Svc: getTrend(goalId, mode, asOf, 30)
Svc --> Ctrl: GoalTrendDto
Ctrl -> Ctrl: highlightedIndex recompute
Ctrl -> Adp: updateDataset(new dataset)
Adp -> Chart: chart.update('none')

note right of Adp
  No Angular re-create.\nNo new <canvas>.
end note

@enduml
